  "That backup is in format {version}, which this build doesn't know how to read.": "Nuqulkaas kaydka ah wuxuu ku jiraa qaabka {version}, oo dhismahani uusan garanayn sida loo akhriyo.",
  "That doesn't look like a URL. Paste an addon link, or one starting with https://": "Kani uma eka URL. Dheji xiriir kordhiye ah, ama mid ku bilaabma https://",
  "That file isn't JSON, so it isn't a backup.": "Faylkaas ma aha JSON, sidaas darteed nuqul kayd ahna ma aha.",
  "That isn't a Ventic backup.": "Kani ma aha nuqul kayd ah oo Ventic.",
  "That picture couldn't be saved. Try a smaller one, or a JPEG or PNG.": "Sawirkaas lama kaydin karin. Isku day mid ka yar, ama JPEG ama PNG.",
