  "The download didn't finish.": "Soo dejintii ma dhammaan.",
  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "Linkiga uu ilahan bixiyay wuxuu ku jawaabay HTTP {status}. Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu dhacay — mar kale ka raadi ilaha mid cusub.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Xiriirka ay isha kani bixisay lama gaari karin.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "Sawirka hadda barnaamijka ka dambeeya",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Aagga ciyaaruhu marnaba cabbir ma helin, sidaas darteed ciyaartu ma bilaabmin.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Ciyaaraha laftiisa — furid, qoraal hoose iyo cod. GPLv2 ama mid ka dambeeya.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Mashruucu ma martigeliyo, ma maamulo, ma taageero mana talin karo il kasta, liiskoodana ma qeybiyo.",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Sii deyntu ma laha cusboonaysiin madal tan.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Ishu horeba way soo qaadatay tan — isla markiiba way ciyaartaa oo waxba qalabkan kuma reebto",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Mishiinka torrent wuu aqbalay magnet-ka laakiin aqoonsi ma siin.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Mishiinka torrent, oo barnaamijka lagu dhex dhisay. Shatiga MIT.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Qulqulka torrent weli diyaar ma aha (mishiinku wuxuu ku jawaabay HTTP {status}). Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu weli ka soo qaadanayo xogta meta ee asxaabta.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Cusboonaysiinta lama rakibi karin: {error}",
  "Theme": "Mowduuc",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Halkan si dirqi ah ayaa hal filim meel loo helayaa. Sanduuqa ku xir diskka USB — oo loo habeeyay FAT32, oo sanduuq kasta oo Android uu aqbalo — kadibna wuxuu kor ka soo muuqan doonaa si aad ugu soo dejiso.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Ma jiro akoon aad ku gasho, waxna server lama isku dubbaridayo. Waxa aad daawato, ilaa xaggee aad gaadhay, kuwa aad jeceshahay iyo liiskaaga daawashadaba waxay ku kaydsan yihiin qalabkan mana ka baxaan. Isku-dubbaridka shaashadaha dhexdooda waa la qorsheeyay; ilaa markaas, nuqulka kaydka ee hoos ku yaal ayaa ah sida maktabaddu u guurto.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Faylalka dukumentiyadaada kuma jiro {file}. Mid halkaas ku koobi kadibna isku day mar kale.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Xiriirkani hadda waa mid la cabbiro.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Xiriirkani hadda ma aha mid la cabbiro.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Nuqulkan ma rakibin rakibaha Ventic laftiisa — waxaa rakibay maamulaha xirmooyinka, ama waa laga dhisay isha — sidaas darteed waxa halkaas dhigay ayaa cusboonaysiiya. Faylasha halkan ka beddelku wuxuu kaliya wareerin lahaa.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Furaha qalabkani wuu ka quustay faylkan. Badanaa waa codka: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) iyo DTS shati kuma laha muuqaalka web ee nidaamka, sidaas darteed sii deyn mid ka mid ah wadata waxay u ciyaartaa sawir cod la'aan ah, ama gebi ahaanba ma ciyaarto. Sii deyn x264 oo leh cod AAC way ciyaari doontaa.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Faylkan wuxuu leeyahay hal waddo cod ah.",
  "Timing": "Waqti-hagaajin",
