  "Trending": "Caan noqonaya",
  "Try again": "Isku day mar kale",
  "Turns off the effects that cost the most to draw: the frosted blur behind the sidebar and menus, the blur on the background art, and the fades and slides that play as things appear or take focus. Everything stays where it was and nothing is hidden — it stops moving and goes crisp instead. Loading spinners keep turning.": "Waxay damisaa saamaynta ugu qaalisan ee la sawiro: muusnaanta muraayadda ah ee ka dambeysa barta dhinaca iyo liisaska, muusnaanta sawirka asalka, iyo isbeddellada iyo simbiriirixadyada ciyaara marka waxyaabo soo muuqdaan ama diirad helaan. Wax kastaa waxay ku hadhaan meeshoodii oo waxba lama qariyo — kaliya way joojiyaan dhaqaaqa oo way caddaadaan. Wareegyada soo shubidda way sii wareegayaan.",
  "Type in the search box to find movies and shows.": "Ku qor sanduuqa raadinta si aad u hesho filimo iyo taxane.",
  "Unmute (m)": "Cod dib u shid (m)",
  "Unreadable": "Lama akhriyi karo",
  "Untitled": "Cinwaan la'aan",
  "Upcoming": "Dhawaan",
  "Update now": "Hadda cusboonaysii",
  "Updates": "Cusboonaysiinta",
  "Updates are checked in the installed app, not here.": "Cusboonaysiinta waxaa lagu hubiyaa barnaamijka la rakibay, ee ma aha halkan.",
  "Upload": "Soo dirid",
  "Use default": "Isticmaal caadiga ah",
  "Use this colour": "Isticmaal midabkan",
  "Ventic asks a source for {movie}, or {series}, and expects a {streams} array back. Add several and their results are merged, with duplicates dropped and earlier sources preferred.": "Ventic wuxuu isha weydiiyaa {movie} ama {series}, wuxuuna filayaa in la soo celiyo shax {streams}. Ku dar dhowr, natiijooyinkooda waa la isku darayaa, kuwa isku midka ah waa la tuurayaa, ilaha hore lagu daray ayaana mudnaanta leh.",
  "Ventic downloads the new package and Android asks you to confirm the install. It is signed with the same key as the copy you have, so it upgrades in place and keeps your library.": "Ventic wuxuu soo dejiyaa xirmada cusub, Android-na wuxuu kaa codsanayaa inaad xaqiijiso rakibaadda. Waxaa lagu saxeexay furaha isku mid ah ee nuqulkaaga, sidaas darteed goobtiisa ayuu ku cusboonaysiiyaa oo maktabaddaada ilaaliyaa.",
  "Ventic has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "Ventic ma laha il la dejiyay, sidaas darteed meel la raadiyo ma jirto. Weli waad ciyaari kartaa magnet ama fayl torrent aad adigu furto.",
  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "Ventic ma martigeliyo wax nuxur ah, mana liisgareeyo, wuxuuna yimaadaa isaga oo aan lahayn il la dejiyay. Waa macmiil BitTorrent oo leh ciyaare ku dheggan: wuxuu keenaa oo kaliya waxa aad u tilmaamto, oo ka yimaada server-yo aad adigu ku dartay.",
  "Ventic is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "Ventic wuxuu ku hoos jiraa shatiga MIT. Qaybaha uu ku dhisan yahay waxay hayaan shuruudahooda, oo kor ku qoran; Windows-ka mpv-ga la keenay waa software GPL, shatigiisa iyo bixinta isha waxay ag yaalliin faylka la fulin karo ee barnaamijka.",
  "Ventic is free and always will be. If it earned one, you can buy me a coffee.": "Ventic waa bilaash wuxuuna sidaas ahaan doonaa weligiis. Haddii uu mudan yahay, kafee ii soo iibin kartaa.",
  "Ventic is up to date.": "Ventic waa mid cusub.",
  "Ventic keeps your library on this device. Carrying it to another screen is the backup file below.": "Ventic wuxuu maktabaddaada ku hayaa qalabkan. Si aad shaashad kale ugu qaadatid waxaa jira faylka kaydka ee hoose.",
  "Ventic searches nothing by itself. A source is a URL you add here, pointing at a server that answers with things to play. What a source offers, and whether you have the right to play it, is between you and whoever runs it.": "Ventic keligiis waxba ma raadiyo. Il waa URL aad halkan ku darto, oo tilmaamaya server ku jawaabaya waxyaabo la ciyaari karo. Waxa ay ishu bixiso, iyo inaad xaq u leedahay inaad ciyaarto, waa arrin ku saabsan adiga iyo qofka maamula.",
  "Ventic speaks the {protocol}. Any Stremio addon URL works here — paste the {link} link or the {manifest} address and it'll be trimmed to what's needed.": "Ventic wuxuu ku hadlaa {protocol}. Halkan waxaa ka shaqeeya URL kasta oo kordhiye Stremio ah — dheji xiriirka {link} ama cinwaanka {manifest}, wuxuuna u gaabsan doonaa waxa loo baahan yahay.",
  "Ventic will send it the title you're looking for and play what it hands back. Only add servers you trust — this one is not run by, or checked by, this app.": "Ventic wuxuu u diri doonaa cinwaanka aad raadinayso wuxuuna ciyaari doonaa waxa uu soo celiyo. Kaliya ku dar server-yo aad aamintid — kan barnaamijkani ma maamulo mana hubiyo.",
  "Ventic {version} is out": "Ventic {version} waa soo baxay",
