  "What language the app is in, and what language film and show descriptions are fetched in.": "Luqadda barnaamijku ku jiro, iyo luqadda sharraxaadda filimada iyo taxanaha lagu soo qaato.",
  "What sits behind the app": "Waxa barnaamijka ka dambeeya",
  "Whatever the disk allows": "Inta diskku oggol yahay",
  "Where downloads go": "Meesha soo dejintu tagto",
  "Where films and episodes are written. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Meesha filimada iyo qeybaha lagu qoro. Torrent-yada horeba loo soo dejiyay meeshoodii ayay joogaan.",
  "Where to keep downloads": "Meesha lagu hayo soo dejinta",
  "Which drive films and episodes are written to — a plugged-in stick usually holds far more than the box itself. Uninstalling the app still removes them. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Diskka filimada iyo qeybaha lagu qoro — USB la xiray badanaa wuxuu qaataa wax ka badan sanduuqa laftiisa. Haddii barnaamijka la saaro way baabba'ayaan si kastaba. Torrent-yada horeba loo soo dejiyay meeshoodii ayay joogaan.",
  "Worth turning on wherever the app feels heavy — a television or a set-top box most of all, where the graphics chip is a fraction of a laptop's.": "Waa mid mudan in la shido meel kasta oo barnaamijku ku culus yahay — gaar ahaan telefishan ama sanduuq TV, halkaas oo shibirka garaafikada uu yahay qayb yar oo kaliya oo kombuyuutar la qaadan karo.",
